    {"name": "Scale Random, Rotate Random", "meaning": "Randomize each cell's scale and rotation."},
    {"name": "Random Seed", "meaning": "Changes the randomized result."},
    {"name": "Contrast, Falloff, Weight Exp", "meaning": "Look of the transitions between cells. A Falloff of 0 gives a hard transition."},
    {"name": "Per-axis Scale, Rotate, Offset (X, Y, Z)", "meaning": "Adjusts the texture in each projection."},
